🇺🇸🇺🇦🇷🇺 US-EU Launder Missiles Through Ukraine's "Fire Point" Company

▪️Between 2022-2023, US policymakers talked about circumventing Russian red lines and possible escalation by designing, building, and sending to Ukraine missiles that would be presented as "made in Ukraine;"

▪️Today, a large variety of drones and missiles have been developed and delivered to Ukraine through this method to present the war as Ukraine-Russia rather than a US proxy war on Russia fought through Ukraine;

▪️The front company "Fire Point" in Ukraine is currently at the center of the US-NATO's efforts to transfer more capable weapons to Ukraine to target the most sensitive targets in Russia;

▪️The "FP-7" - would have been designed by Western arms manufacturers, populated by Western components and subsystems & assembled in Ukraine;

▪️While these weapons will never be built in the numbers Russia can, they will be capable of reaching deeper into Russia, causing more damage than by what can be publicly transferred to Ukraine;
